#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/release-notes.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Release Notes"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ (Release Notes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/help/release-notes.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Help[Release Notes] section opens the current version of the "
"{productname} Release Notes in a new browser tab."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Help[Release Notes] ຈະເປີດ Release Notes ຂອງ {productname} ເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນໃນແທັບບຣາວເຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູໜ້າຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Home`` section is a dashboard that contains a summary of your "
"current {productname} status, including tasks, client information, and "
"critical security updates."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Home`` ແມ່ນແດຊບອດທີ່ລວມເອົາບົດສະຫຼຸບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງວຽກງານ, ຂໍ້ມູນໄຄເອັນ, ແລະ ການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Preferences] section allows you to configure {productname} "
"{webui} options."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Preferences] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆຂອງ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າຫຼັກ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                | Description   | Default\n"
"| Email Notification    | Receive email for client and Taskomatic "
"notifications, including a daily summary email. | Checked\n"
"| Beta Features         | Beta features are experimental and may not be "
"fully tested. Enable this option to access new functionality that is still "
"under development. Use with caution in production environments. | "
"Unchecked\n"
"| {productname} List Page Size | Maximum number of items that can appear in "
"a list on a single page. | 25 entries\n"
"| \"Overview\" Start Page | Select the information panes to display on the "
"menu:Home[Overview] page. | All checked\n"
"| Time Zone             | Set your local timezone. | System timezone\n"
"| Interface Language    | Set the language to use in the {webui}. | Default "
"language\n"
"| Style Theme           | Set the style theme to use in the {webui}. | "
"``susemanager-light``\n"
"| CSV Files             | Select whether to use comma or semi-colon "
"delimiters when producing downloadable CSV files. | Comma\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ                | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ   | ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"| Email Notification    | ຮັບອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບໄຄເອັນ ແລະ Taskomatic, ລວມທັງອີເມລສະຫຼຸບປະຈຳວັນ. | ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້\n"
"| Beta Features         | ຄຸນສົມບັດເບຕ້າແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ ແລະ ອາດຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່. ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນໃໝ່ໆທີ່ກຳລັງພັດທະນາ. ຄວນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. | ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ\n"
"| {productname} List Page Size | ຈຳນວນລາຍການສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໜ້າ. | 25 ລາຍການ\n"
"| \"Overview\" Start Page | ເລືອກແຜງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນໜ້າ menu:Home[Overview]. | ໝາຍເລືອກທັງໝົດ\n"
"| Time Zone             | ກຳນົດເຂດເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງທ່ານ. | ເຂດເວລາຂອງລະບົບ\n"
"| Interface Language    | ກຳນົດພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ {webui}. | ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"| Style Theme           | ກຳນົດຮູບແບບ (Theme) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ {webui}. | ``susemanager-light``\n"
"| CSV Files             | ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຈຸດ (comma) ຫຼື ເຊມິໂຄລອນ (semi-colon) ເປັນຕົວແບ່ງໃນໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດ. | ຈຸດ (Comma)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-my-preferences.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For information about changing the default preferences, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notification Messages"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[Notification Messages] section shows all current messages "
"produced by {productname}.  By default, messages will remain current for "
"thirty days.  After this period, messages are deleted whether or not they "
"are marked as read."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[Notification Messages] ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນເວລາສາມສິບວັນ. ຫຼັງຈາກໄລຍະເວລານີ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າອ່ານແລ້ວ ຫຼື ບໍ່ກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To see unread messages, navigate to the [guimenu]``Unread Messages`` tab.  "
"To see all messages, navigate to the [guimenu]``All Messages`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ອ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Unread Messages``. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``All Messages``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:4
msgid "Click btn:[Refresh] to update the list."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Refresh] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking messages in the list.  Click btn:[Delete "
"selected messages] to bulk delete messages.  Click btn:[Mark selected as "
"read] to bulk read messages."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການແບບກຸ່ມໂດຍການໝາຍຕິກເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Delete selected messages] ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນກຸ່ມ. ຄລິກ btn:[Mark selected as read] ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າອ່ານແລ້ວເປັນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notification Message Severity Statuses"
msgstr "ສະຖານະລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-notification-messages.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon               | Description   | Example\n"
"| icon:info-circle[role=\"none\"] | Information | Client onboarding has "
"failed.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | Warning | Channel "
"synchronization has completed.\n"
"| icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] | Error | Channel synchronization has "
"failed.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ໄອຄອນ               | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ   | ຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
"| icon:info-circle[role=\"none\"] | ຂໍ້ມູນ | ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໄຄເອັນ (onboarding) ລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"| icon:exclamation-triangle[role=\"orange\"] | ຄຳເຕືອນ | ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"| icon:times-circle[role=\"red\"] | ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ | ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Home Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມໜ້າຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/home-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[Overview] section is a dashboard that contains a summary of "
"your current {productname} status, including tasks, client information, and "
"critical security updates."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[Overview] ແມ່ນແດຊບອດທີ່ລວມເອົາບົດສະຫຼຸບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງວຽກງານ, ຂໍ້ມູນໄຄເອັນ, ແລະ ການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels] section shows the "
"configuration channels available within your organization.  Configuration "
"channels can be created in the {productname} {webui} by navigating to "
"menu:Configuration[Channels].  Apply configuration channels to your "
"organization using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration Channels] ສະແດງຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີໃຫ້ພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels]. ປັບໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration] section allows you to "
"configure your current organization."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Configuration Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                            | Description   | Default\n"
"| Enable staging contents | For clients in this organization, allow content "
"staging by default. | Unchecked\n"
"| Enable Errata E-mail Notifications | For users in this organization, send "
"email notifications when errata (patches) are available. | Checked\n"
"| Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files | Allow detailed SCAP content files "
"to be uploaded for auditing. | Unchecked\n"
"| Allow Deletion of SCAP Results | Allow SCAP results to be deleted after "
"the audit is complete. | Checked\n"
"| Allow Deletion After | The number of days after an SCAP audit is complete, "
"that results can be deleted. | 90 days\n"
"| Synchronize patches on Content Lifecycle Management build | Controls "
"whether the patch attributes and affected packages should be synchronized to "
"cloned patches when building a content Project | Checked\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ                            | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ   | ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"| Enable staging contents | ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນໃນອົງກອນນີ້, ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ content staging ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. | ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ\n"
"| Enable Errata E-mail Notifications | ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນອົງກອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີ errata (ແພັດ) ໃໝ່. | ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້\n"
"| Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files | ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ SCAP ແບບລະອຽດເພື່ອການກວດສອບ. | ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ\n"
"| Allow Deletion of SCAP Results | ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລຶບຜົນການກວດສອບ SCAP ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບສຳເລັດ. | ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້\n"
"| Allow Deletion After | ຈຳນວນມື້ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບ SCAP ສຳເລັດ ທີ່ສາມາດລຶບຜົນໄດ້. | 90 ມື້\n"
"| Synchronize patches on Content Lifecycle Management build | ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຄວນຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄປຍັງແພັດທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ (cloned patches) ໃນເວລາສ້າງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາຫຼືບໍ່ | ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about content staging, see "
"xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ content staging, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:content-staging.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting SCAP scan results, see "
"xref:administration:openscap.adoc#removing-scap-scan-results[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຜົນການສະແກນ SCAP, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:openscap.adoc#removing-scap-scan-results[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-configuration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about Content Lifecycle Management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Organization"
msgstr "ອົງກອນຂອງຂ້ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization] section allows you to configure your current "
"organization."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Organization] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າອົງກອນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Organization Trusts"
msgstr "ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືລະຫວ່າງອົງກອນ (Organization Trusts)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[My Organization > Organization Trusts] section shows the "
"trusts that you have established within your organization.  This section "
"also shows the channels that are available to other users through trusts."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Organization > Organization Trusts] ສະແດງຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຍັງສະແດງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆຜ່ານຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/my-organization-trusts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about organization trusts, see "
"xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືລະຫວ່າງອົງກອນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:organizations.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account Deactivation"
msgstr "ການຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Account Deactivation] section allows you to "
"cancel your {productname} user account."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[User Account > Account Deactivation] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Deactivate Account] your user account will be deleted, "
"you will be signed out, and you will not be able to sign back in."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ btn:[Deactivate Account], ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກລຶບ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກອອກຈາກລະບົບ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄືນໄດ້ອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you do this by accident, you will need to contact your {productname} "
"Administrator to reactivate your user account."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍບັງເອີນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-account-deactivation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you are the only {productname} Administrator for your organization, you "
"can not deactivate your account."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ພຽງຄົນດຽວສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Addresses] section allows you set your mailing, "
"billing, and shipping addresses, and associated phone numbers."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[User Account > Addresses] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ທາງໄປສະນີ, ທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບການຮຽກເກັບເງິນ, ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບການຈັດສົ່ງ, ລວມທັງເບີໂທລະສັບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-addresses.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Fill in this address] or btn:[Edit this address] below the "
"address to be modified or added, make your changes, and click btn:[Update]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Fill in this address] ຫຼື btn:[Edit this address] ຢູ່ລຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມ, ທຳການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Email"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນອີເມລ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > Change Email] section allows you to set the "
"email {productname} sends notifications to."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[User Account > Change Email] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດອີເມລທີ່ {productname} ຈະສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Enter your new email address and click the btn:[Update] button.  Invalid "
"email addresses, including those ending in [literal]``@localhost`` are "
"filtered and rejected."
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Update]. ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ລວມທັງທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [literal]``@localhost`` ຈະຖືກກັ່ນຕອງ ແລະ ປະຕິເສດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-change-email.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you would like to receive email notifications about patch alerts or daily "
"summaries for your systems, ensure you have checked the [guimenu]``Receive "
"email notifications`` option in menu:Home[My Preferences] section."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮັບອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແພັດ ຫຼື ບົດສະຫຼຸບປະຈຳວັນສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Receive email notifications`` ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[My Preferences] ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account] section allows you to change user account "
"preferences."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[User Account] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "My Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີຂອງຂ້ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Home[User Account > My Account] section allows you to change user "
"account preferences."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[User Account > My Account] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Modify your personal information, such as name, password, and title from the "
"menu:Home[User Account > My Account] page.  To modify this information, make "
"the changes in the appropriate text fields and click the btn:[Update] button "
"at the bottom."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊື່, ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລະ ຄຳນຳໜ້າ ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Home[User Account > My Account]. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນນີ້, ໃຫ້ທຳການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Update] ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/home/user-account-my-account.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you forget your password or username, navigate to {webui} sign in page, "
"click btn:[About], and click btn:[Lookup Login/Password].  Enter the "
"username or email address, and click btn:[Send Password] or btn:[Send Login] "
"to have the missing information sent to you."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານລືມລະຫັດຜ່ານ ຫຼື ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui}, ຄລິກ btn:[About], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Lookup Login/Password]. ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Send Password] ຫຼື btn:[Send Login] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປໃຫ້ທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Build"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Images[Build] section allows you to build operating system images "
"for installing on clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Images[Build] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ operating system images ສຳລັບຕິດຕັ້ງໃນໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Build Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການສ້າງ Image"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option        | Description   | Default\n"
"| Image Profile | Select the image profile to use.\n"
"Manage image profiles at menu:Images[Profiles]. | Blank.\n"
"| Build Host    | Select the build host for the new image. | Blank.\n"
"| Earliest      | Schedule the time and date for the build to begin. | "
"Current system time and date.\n"
"| Add to        | Select which action chain to add the build task to. | New "
"action chain.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ        | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ   | ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"| Image Profile | ເລືອກ image profile ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້.\n"
"ຈັດການ image profiles ທີ່ menu:Images[Profiles]. | ຫວ່າງ.\n"
"| Build Host    | ເລືອກ build host ສຳລັບ image ໃໝ່. | ຫວ່າງ.\n"
"| Earliest      | ຕັ້ງເວລາ ແລະ ວັນທີເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການສ້າງ. | ເວລາ ແລະ ວັນທີປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລະບົບ.\n"
"| Add to        | ເລືອກວ່າຈະເພີ່ມວຽກງານການສ້າງເຂົ້າໃນ action chain ໃດ. | Action chain ໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:5
msgid "Built images are listed in menu:Images[Image List]."
msgstr "Image ທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວຈະຖືກສະແດງລາຍການໃນ menu:Images[Image List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-build.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about images, see "
"xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ images, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image List"
msgstr "ລາຍການ Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Images[Image List] section displays your current operating system "
"images."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Images[Image List] ສະແດງ operating system images ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Import] to import a new Docker image.  You can only import new "
"images created from a Docker image using this mechanism.  To import images "
"based on Kiwi instead, see xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Import] ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ Docker image ໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ image ໃໝ່ທີ່ສ້າງຈາກ Docker image ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ image ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Kiwi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking images in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] to "
"bulk delete images."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການແບບກຸ່ມໂດຍການໝາຍຕິກເລືອກ image ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ເພື່ອລຶບ image ເປັນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image List Columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳຂອງລາຍການ Image"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-image-list.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column               | Description\n"
"| Name                 | Name of the image.\n"
"| Version and Revision | Version and revision of the image.\n"
"| Updates              | Any updates that are currently available for the "
"image.\n"
"| Patches and Packages | Any patches or packages that are currently "
"available for the image.\n"
"| Build                | The current status of the build: ``Built``, "
"``Scheduled``, ``Building`` or ``Failed``.\n"
"| Last Modified        | The time and date the image was last modified.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄໍລຳ               | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Name                 | ຊື່ຂອງ image.\n"
"| Version and Revision | ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ລຸ້ນປັບປຸງ (revision) ຂອງ image.\n"
"| Updates              | ການອັບເດດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ image ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"| Patches and Packages | ແພັດ ຫຼື ແພັກເກດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ image ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"| Build                | ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງການສ້າງ: ``Built``, ``Scheduled``, ``Building`` ຫຼື ``Failed``.\n"
"| Last Modified        | ເວລາ ແລະ ວັນທີທີ່ image ຖືກແກ້ໄຂຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູ Image"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Profiles"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Images[Profiles] section displays your current image profiles."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Images[Profiles] ສະແດງ image profiles ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to create a new image profile.  Click btn:[Refresh] to "
"update the list."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງ image profile ໃໝ່. ຄລິກ btn:[Refresh] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-profiles.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking profiles in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] "
"to bulk delete profiles."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການແບບກຸ່ມໂດຍການໝາຍຕິກເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ເພື່ອລຶບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເປັນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images Stores"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບ Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Images[Stores] section displays your current image stores."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Images[Stores] ສະແດງ image stores ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] to create a new image store.  Click btn:[Refresh] to "
"update the list."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງ image store ໃໝ່. ຄລິກ btn:[Refresh] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/images/images-stores.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Perform bulk actions by checking images in the list.  Click btn:[Delete] to "
"bulk delete image stores."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການແບບກຸ່ມໂດຍການໝາຍຕິກເລືອກ image ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Delete] ເພື່ອລຶບ image stores ເປັນກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone Patches"
msgstr "ໂຄລນແພັດ (Clone Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Clone Patches] section allows you to create copies of "
"existing patches to distribute to your clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Clone Patches] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອແຈກຢາຍໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To clone a patch, the patch must apply to one of your existing software "
"channels.  If the patch was part of a software channel that was cloned, then "
"you can clone the patch from the cloned channel."
msgstr "ໃນການໂຄລນແພັດ, ແພັດນັ້ນຕ້ອງກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ. ຖ້າແພັດນັ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໂຄລນແພັດຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/clone-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"See all patches that are available for cloning by selecting the channel name "
"in the [guimenu]``View patches potentially applicable to:`` field, and click "
"btn:[View].  From the list, check the patch to clone, and click btn:[Clone "
"Patch].  You need to confirm the details to perform the clone."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂຄລນໂດຍການເລືອກຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``View patches potentially applicable to:``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[View]. ຈາກລາຍການ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກແພັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂຄລນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Clone Patch]. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດເພື່ອດຳເນີນການໂຄລນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Patches"
msgstr "ຈັດການແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Patches[Manage Patches] section shows you all custom patches."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Manage Patches] ສະແດງແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory name, a short "
"description, and the date the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory "
"name to go to menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] for the patch."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັດໃນລາຍການຈະສະແດງປະເພດຂອງແພັດ, ຊື່ advisory, ຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້, ແລະ ວັນທີທີ່ແພັດຖືກອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ advisory ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] ສຳລັບແພັດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To create a new patch, click btn:[Create Patch].  To delete a patch, select "
"it in the list, and click btn:[Delete Patches]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອ້ອງການສ້າງແພັດໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create Patch]. ເພື່ອລຶບແພັດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແພັດໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Delete Patches]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you use {productname} with a proxy, manage patches only on the "
"{productname} Server.  The {productname} Proxy will receive updates from the "
"server directly.  If you manage patches on a proxy, the servers will be "
"unable to synchronize correctly."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ {productname} ຮ່ວມກັບ proxy, ໃຫ້ຈັດການແພັດສະເພາະໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. {productname} Proxy ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຈາກເຊີເວີໂດຍກົງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຈັດການແພັດໃນ proxy, ເຊີເວີຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/manage-patches.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about patching, see "
"xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການແພັດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] section displays the details of "
"a selected patch.  Click the advisory number of a patch in the "
"[menuitem]``Patch List`` to see more information about the patch."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແພັດທີ່ເລືອກ. ຄລິກໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ advisory ຂອງແພັດໃນ [menuitem]``Patch List`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:3
msgid "This section is divided into tabs."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນຫຼາຍແທັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/users/user-details.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:5
msgid "The [menuitem]``Details`` tab shows the patch report provided by {suse}."
msgstr "ແທັບ [menuitem]``Details`` ສະແດງລາຍງານແພັດທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Affected Channels`` section, all channels that contain the "
"affected package are listed.  Click the channel name to go to "
"menu:Software[Channel Details]."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Affected Channels``, ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສະແດງລາຍການ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Channel Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For security patches, additional information is shown about the "
"vulnerability, including the CVE and OVAL details."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແພັດຄວາມປອດໄພ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່, ລວມທັງລາຍລະອຽດ CVE ແລະ OVAL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If available, the original advisory provided by the vendor of the patch is "
"shown in the section [guimenu]``Vendor Advisory``."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີ, advisory ຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍຜູ້ຜະລິດແພັດຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Vendor Advisory``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about {suse} Update Advisories, see "
"link:https://www.suse.com/support/update/[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {suse} Update Advisories, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://www.suse.com/support/update/[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:10
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-packages.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-states.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The [menuitem]``Packages`` tab provides links to each of the updated "
"packages by channel.  Click the name of a package to go to "
"menu:Software[Channel Details]."
msgstr "ແທັບ [menuitem]``Packages`` ໃຫ້ລິ້ງໄປຫາແຕ່ລະແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດແຍກຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ແພັກເກດເພື່ອໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Channel Details]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Affected Systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The [menuitem]``Affected Systems`` tab provides a list of installed clients "
"that the patch affects.  You can install updates from this tab."
msgstr "ແທັບ [menuitem]``Affected Systems`` ໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກແພັດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໄດ້ຈາກແທັບນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:14
msgid "Click the name of a client to go to menu:Systems[System Details]."
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ໄຄເອັນເພື່ອໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Details]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Each client in the list shows the current status of the patch on that "
"client.  This column identifies only the most recent action.  Click the name "
"of a status in the list to go to the [guimenu]``Action Details`` page."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະໄຄເອັນໃນລາຍການຈະສະແດງສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງແພັດໃນເຄື່ອງນັ້ນ. ຄໍລຳນີ້ລະບຸສະເພາະການດຳເນີນການຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ສະຖານະໃນລາຍການເພື່ອໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``Action Details``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Update Status Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສະຖານະການອັບເດດໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-details.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description | Action Required\n"
"| N/A | Check the status manually.\n"
"| Pending | The client will be updated at the next synchronization.\n"
"| Picked Up | The client is in the progress of updating.\n"
"| Completed | The client successfully installed the patch.\n"
"| Failed | The client attempted to install the patch, but encountered an "
"error.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈຳເປັນ\n"
"| N/A | ກວດສອບສະຖານະດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"
"| Pending | ໄຄເອັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"
"| Picked Up | ໄຄເອັນກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເດດ.\n"
"| Completed | ໄຄເອັນຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"
"| Failed | ໄຄເອັນພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດ ແຕ່ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດທັງໝົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > All] section displays a list of all patches "
"released by {suse}.  Not all of the patches will apply to your clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Patch List > All] ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ປ່ອຍໂດຍ {suse}. ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກແພັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບໄຄເອັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory number, a short "
"description, the number of clients in your network affected, and the date "
"the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory number to see more "
"information about the patch."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັດໃນລາຍການຈະສະແດງປະເພດຂອງແພັດ, ໝາຍເລກ advisory, ຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້, ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ແລະ ວັນທີທີ່ແພັດຖືກອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຄລິກໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ advisory ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-all.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Icon | Description | Action Required\n"
"| icon:bug[role=\"none\"] | Bug fix | Recommended\n"
"| image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[] | Product enhancement advisory | "
"Optional\n"
"| icon:shield-alt[role=\"yellow\"] | Security update | Essential\n"
"| icon:archive[role=\"none\"]| Affects package management stack | "
"Recommended\n"
msgstr ""
"| ໄອຄອນ | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈຳເປັນ\n"
"| icon:bug[role=\"none\"] | ແກ້ໄຂບັກ | ແນະນຳ\n"
"| image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[] | ການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຜະລິດຕະພັນ | ທາງເລືອກ\n"
"| icon:shield-alt[role=\"yellow\"] | ອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ | ຈຳເປັນ\n"
"| icon:archive[role=\"none\"]| ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລະບົບການຈັດການແພັກເກດ | ແນະນຳ\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Patch List > Relevant] section displays a list of all "
"patches released by {suse} that apply to your installed clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Patch List > Relevant] ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ປ່ອຍໂດຍ {suse} ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Each patch in the list shows a patch type, an advisory number, a short "
"description, the number of clients in your network affected, and the date "
"the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory number to see more "
"information about the patch.  For more information about the "
"menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details] section, see "
"xref:reference:patches/patch-details.adoc[]"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັດໃນລາຍການຈະສະແດງປະເພດຂອງແພັດ, ໝາຍເລກ advisory, ຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້, ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ແລະ ວັນທີທີ່ແພັດຖືກອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຄລິກໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ advisory ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Patch List > Patch Details], ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:patches/patch-details.adoc[]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patch-list-relevant.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To receive email when new patches are available, navigate to menu:Home[My "
"Preferences] and check [guimenu]``Receive email notifications``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບອີເມລເມື່ອມີແພັດໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Preferences] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Receive email notifications``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Search for Patches"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາແພັດແບບລະອຽດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Patches[Advanced Search] section allows you to use advanced "
"criteria to search for patches."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Patches[Advanced Search] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເກນການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can search for patches by looking for your search term in different "
"fields:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາແພັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຊອກຫາຄຳຄົ້ນຫາຂອງທ່ານໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Advanced Search Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຄົ້ນຫາແພັດແບບລະອຽດ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option         | Description | Example\n"
"| All Fields     | Search in all fields | ``glibc``\n"
"| Patch Advisory | Search within the name or label fields | "
"``slessp1-glibc``\n"
"| Package Name   | Search within the package name field only | ``kernel``\n"
"| CVE            | Search within the CVE name or number field only | "
"``CVE-2006-4535``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ         | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
"| All Fields     | ຄົ້ນຫາໃນທຸກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ | ``glibc``\n"
"| Patch Advisory | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ ຫຼື ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) | ``slessp1-glibc``\n"
"| Package Name   | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ແພັກເກດເທົ່ານັ້ນ | ``kernel``\n"
"| CVE            | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ CVE ຫຼື ໝາຍເລກ CVE ເທົ່ານັ້ນ | ``CVE-2006-4535``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-advanced-search.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also search within different types of patches, or within a range of "
"issue dates."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຕາມປະເພດຕ່າງໆຂອງແພັດ, ຫຼື ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງວັນທີທີ່ອອກແພັດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/patches/patches-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Patches`` menu helps you find and manage available patches "
"for your clients."
msgstr "ເມນູ [guimenu]``Patches`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຈັດການແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference Guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືອ້າງອີງ"

#.  PDF Publication
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:20
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Publication Date:** {docdate}\n"
