#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:11
msgid "This document is divided into several sections:"
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນຫຼາຍພາກສ່ວນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:17
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**{webui} Reference:** Organized to mirror the structure of the "
"{productname} {webui}, this section allows you to quickly find relevant "
"information while navigating the interface.  \n"
msgstr "**{webui} Reference:** ຖືກຈັດລະບຽບໃຫ້ຄືກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂອງ {productname} {webui}, ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ງານສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:18
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**spacecmd Reference:** A comprehensive guide to the [command]``spacecmd`` "
"command-line interface. It includes an **alphabetized list** of all "
"available commands along with their correct usage.  \n"
msgstr "**spacecmd Reference:** ຄູ່ມືທີ່ສົມບູນແບບສຳລັບ [command]``spacecmd`` command-line interface. ມັນລວມມີ **ລາຍຊື່ຄຳສັ່ງຕາມລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນ** ຂອງທຸກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ພ້ອມກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:19
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Command Line Tools:** An overview of the various **command-line "
"utilities** available in {productname}, helping you streamline "
"administrative tasks. \n"
msgstr "**Command Line Tools:** ພາບລວມຂອງ **ເຄື່ອງມືຄຳສັ່ງ** ຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີໃນ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຮັດວຽກງານການດູແລລະບົບໄດ້ສະດວກຂຶ້ນ. \n"

