"third-party trademarks are the property of their respective "
"owners. Trademark symbols (®, ™ etc.) denote trademarks of SUSE and its "
"affiliates. Asterisks (*) denote third-party trademarks.  All information "
"found in this book has been compiled with utmost attention to "
"detail. However, this does not guarantee complete accuracy. Neither SUSE "
"LLC, its affiliates, the authors nor the translators shall be held liable "
"for possible errors or the consequences thereof."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າຂອງ SUSE, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/company/legal/ . ເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມທັງໝົດແມ່ນຊັບສິນຂອງເຈົ້າຂອງນັ້ນໆ. ສັນຍະລັກເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າ (®, ™ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ໝາຍເຖິງເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າຂອງ SUSE ແລະ ບໍລິສັດໃນເຄືອ. ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດາວ (*) ໝາຍເຖິງເຄື່ອງໝາຍການຄ້າຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ. ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກຮິບໂຮມດ້ວຍຄວາມເອົາໃຈໃສ່ຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນແບບ. ທັງ SUSE LLC, ບໍລິສັດໃນເຄືອ, ຜູ້ຂຽນ ຫຼື ຜູ້ແປ ຈະບໍ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບຕໍ່ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຜົນກະທົບຈາກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:24
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/uyuni-reference-overview.adoc:17
msgid "<<<"
msgstr "<<<"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/reference-overview.adoc:15
msgid "Reference | {productname} {productnumber}"
msgstr "ອ້າງອີງ | {productname} {productnumber}"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formula Catalog"
msgstr "ແຄັດຕາລັອກສູດ (Formula Catalog)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Formula Catalog] section allows you to see which formulas are "
"currently installed on your {productname} Server, and are available to be "
"used on your Salt clients.  Install and configure formulas by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Details] for the client you want to configure, and navigate to "
"the guimenu``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Salt[Formula Catalog] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງໄດ້ວ່າສູດ (formulas) ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ Salt clients. ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າສູດໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Details] ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ guimenu``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-formula-catalog.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname} formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບສູດຂອງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "ຄີ (Keys)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Keys] section displays the key fingerprints of your current "
"Salt clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Salt[Keys] ສະແດງ key fingerprints ຂອງ Salt clients ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Key fingerprints are exchanged between the {productname} Server and Salt "
"clients to verify the identity of the server and the client.  This prevents "
"Salt clients from connecting to the wrong server."
msgstr "Key fingerprints ຈະຖືກແລກປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ Salt clients ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Salt clients ເຂົ້າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Refresh] to update the list.  Click the name of a client to go to "
"menu:Systems[Details] for that client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Refresh] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍການ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ໄຄເອັນເພື່ອໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Details] ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Keys List Columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳຂອງລາຍການ Salt Keys"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-keys.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column      | Description\n"
"| Name        | Name of the Salt client.\n"
"| Fingerprint | Key fingerprint of the Salt client.\n"
"| State       | The status of the key exchange: ``accepted`` indicates that "
"the client key has been verified by the {productname} Server.\n"
"| Actions     | Click the ``Delete`` icon to delete the client key from the "
"server.\n"
"Clients that have had their key deleted will need to be onboarded again.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄໍລຳ      | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Name        | ຊື່ຂອງ Salt client.\n"
"| Fingerprint | Key fingerprint ຂອງ Salt client.\n"
"| State       | ສະຖານະຂອງການແລກປ່ຽນຄີ: ``accepted`` ໝາຍເຖິງຄີຂອງໄຄເອັນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນໂດຍ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ.\n"
"| Actions     | ຄລິກໄອຄອນ ``Delete`` ເພື່ອລຶບຄີຂອງໄຄເອັນອອກຈາກເຊີເວີ.\n"
"ໄຄເອັນທີ່ຖືກລຶບຄີອອກຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (onboarded) ໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Salt`` section displays details of your Salt clients.  You "
"can use this menu to perform remote commands or define a state catalog for "
"your Salt clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Salt`` ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ Salt clients ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເມນູນີ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ ຫຼື ກຳນົດ state catalog ສຳລັບ Salt clients ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about using Salt with {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Salt ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote Commands)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Salt[Remote Commands] section allows you to perform remote commands "
"on one or more of your Salt clients.  Remote commands allows you to issue "
"commands to individual Salt clients, or to all clients that match a search "
"term."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Salt[Remote Commands] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສັ່ງການຜ່ານທາງໄກໄປຍັງ Salt clients ໄດ້ໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນ. ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຍັງ Salt client ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ, ຫຼື ໄປຍັງທຸກເຄື່ອງທີ່ກົງກັບຄຳຄົ້ນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/salt/salt-remote-commands.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about remote commands, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Chains"
msgstr "ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ (Action Chains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Action Chains] If you need to perform a number of "
"sequential actions on your clients, you can create an action chain to "
"automate them."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Action Chains] ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະຕິບັດຫຼາຍການດຳເນີນການຕາມລຳດັບໃນໄຄເອັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ action chain ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ວຽກງານເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/action-chains.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about action chains, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ action chains, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈັດເກັບ (Archived Actions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Archived Actions] section shows actions that you have "
"marked as archived.  Use the [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` field to search "
"the list.  Completed or failed actions can be archived."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Archived Actions] ສະແດງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ໝາຍວ່າຈັດເກັບໄວ້. ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໃນລາຍການ. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ລົ້ມເຫຼວສາມາດຖືກຈັດເກັບໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/archived-actions.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:8
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:13
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-events.adoc:3
msgid "For more information about actions, see xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການດຳເນີນການ (actions), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Completed Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Completed Actions] section shows actions that have been "
"successfully completed.  Use the [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` field to "
"search the list.  Archive completed actions by checking the action in the "
"list, and clicking btn:[Archive Actions]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Completed Actions] ສະແດງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ປະຕິບັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໃນລາຍການ. ຈັດເກັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດໂດຍການໝາຍເລືອກໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Archive Actions]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Completed Actions List Columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳຂອງລາຍການການດຳເນີນການທີ່ສຳເລັດ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/completed-actions.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:7
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column         | Description\n"
"| Action         | Type of action to perform.\n"
"Click the action to go to [guimenu]``Action Details``.\n"
"| Scheduled Time | The earliest time to perform the action.\n"
"| Succeeded      | Number of clients on which this action was successful.\n"
"| Failed         | Number of clients on which this action has failed.\n"
"| Pending        | Number of clients on which this action is currently "
"running\n"
"| Total          | Total number of clients on which this action has been "
"scheduled.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄໍລຳ         | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Action         | ປະເພດຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ປະຕິບັດ.\n"
"ຄລິກທີ່ການດຳເນີນການເພື່ອໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Action Details``.\n"
"| Scheduled Time | ເວລາທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດການດຳເນີນການ.\n"
"| Succeeded      | ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນທີ່ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ສຳເລັດ.\n"
"| Failed         | ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນທີ່ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"
"| Pending        | ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນທີ່ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່\n"
"| Total          | ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງເວລາສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Failed Actions] section shows actions that have not been "
"completed, or that have returned an error.  Use the [guimenu]``Filter by "
"Action`` field to search the list.  Archive failed actions by checking the "
"action in the list, and clicking btn:[Archive Actions]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Failed Actions] ສະແດງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ມີການແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໃນລາຍການ. ຈັດເກັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວໂດຍການໝາຍເລືອກໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Archive Actions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Reschedule failed actions by checking the action in the list, and clicking "
"btn:[Reschedule].  Following the rescheduling, the action is:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງເວລາໃໝ່ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວໂດຍການໝາຍເລືອກໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Reschedule]. ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງເວລາໃໝ່, ການດຳເນີນການຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:4
msgid "removed from the [guimenu]``Event History``"
msgstr "ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ [guimenu]``Event History``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:5
msgid "replaced by the rescheduled action."
msgstr "ຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຕັ້ງເວລາໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/failed-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Actions List Columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳຂອງລາຍການການດຳເນີນການ"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Windows"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance Windows)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows] section allows you to manage your "
"maintenance window schedules.  To create a maintenance schedule, you need to "
"have an existing [path]``.ical`` file that contains the calendar.  Upload "
"the calendar, create a new schedule, and assign the schedule to a client.  "
"When a schedule is applied to a client, you are prevented from executing "
"some actions outside of the specified period."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຕາຕະລາງຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ. ເພື່ອສ້າງຕາຕະລາງການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີໄຟລ໌ [path]``.ical`` ທີ່ມີປະຕິທິນຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ອັບໂຫຼດປະຕິທິນ, ສ້າງຕາຕະລາງໃໝ່, ແລະ ມອບໝາຍຕາຕະລາງໃຫ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ. ເມື່ອຕາຕະລາງຖືກປັບໃຊ້ກັບໄຄເອັນ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຫ້າມບໍ່ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດບາງການດຳເນີນການນອກໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules] to see a list of "
"all current schedules.  Click btn:[Create] to create a new schedule.  Click "
"btn:[Edit] to change the schedule."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຕາຕະລາງທັງໝົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕາຕະລາງໃໝ່. ຄລິກ btn:[Edit] ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຕາຕະລາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars] to see a list of "
"all current calendars.  Click btn:[Create] to create a new calendar.  Click "
"btn:[Edit] to change the calendar."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ປະຕິທິນທັງໝົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງປະຕິທິນໃໝ່. ຄລິກ btn:[Edit] ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂປະຕິທິນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/maintenance-windows.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about maintenance windows, see "
"xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:maintenance-windows.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Pending Actions] section shows actions that are in "
"progress, or that have not yet started.  Use the [guimenu]``Filter by "
"Action`` field to search the list."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Pending Actions] ສະແດງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter by Action`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໃນລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/pending-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cancel pending actions by checking the action in the list, and clicking "
"btn:[Cancel Actions].  If you archive a pending action, it is not canceled, "
"but the action item moves from the [guimenu]``Pending Actions`` list to the "
"[guimenu]``Archived Actions`` list."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໂດຍການໝາຍເລືອກໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Cancel Actions]. ຖ້າທ່ານຈັດເກັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແຕ່ລາຍການການດຳເນີນການຈະຍ້າຍຈາກລາຍຊື່ [guimenu]``Pending Actions`` ໄປທີ່ລາຍຊື່ [guimenu]``Archived Actions``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:1
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Schedule[Recurring Actions] section shows all recurring actions "
"that you have permissions for."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Schedule[Recurring Actions] ສະແດງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The recurring actions list on this page is a read-only table.  To modify a "
"schedule, you can follow the links in the [guimenu]``Target Name`` column "
"and list the schedules of an individual target."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆໃນໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບເບິ່ງຢ່າງດຽວ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຕາຕະລາງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກລິ້ງໃນຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Target Name`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຕາຕະລາງຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:4
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Action Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:11
msgid ""
"View the details about an action from the action list.  In the "
"[guimenu]``Actions`` column, click the btn:[Details] icon for the action you "
"are interested in."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການດຳເນີນການຈາກລາຍການ. ໃນຄໍລຳ [guimenu]``Actions``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໄອຄອນ btn:[Details] ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການທີ່ທ່ານສົນໃຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/recurring-actions.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-recurring-actions.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about recurring actions, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູການຕັ້ງເວລາ (Schedule Menu)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Schedule`` section allows you to view actions and action "
"chains."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງການດຳເນີນການ ແລະ ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:3
msgid "Actions include:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Package alterations, including installation, upgrade, removal, and rolling "
"back of packages"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງແພັກເກດ, ລວມທັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ອັບເກຣດ, ການລຶບອອກ, ແລະ ການຍ້ອນກັບ (rolling back) ຂອງແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:5
msgid "Client reboots"
msgstr "ການຣີບູດໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:6
msgid "Patch installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:7
msgid "Configuration file alterations, including deploy, upload, and diff"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ, ລວມທັງການປັບໃຊ້, ການອັບໂຫຼດ, ແລະ ການປຽບທຽບ (diff)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:8
msgid "Hardware profile updates"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:9
msgid "Package list profile updates"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:10
msgid "Automated installation initiation"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:11
msgid "Product migrations"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/schedule/schedule-menu.adoc:12
msgid "Remote commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote commands)"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List > Channel Details] section displays the "
"details of a selected channel.  Click the name of a channel in the "
"[menuitem]``Channel List`` to see more information about the channel."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Channel List > Channel Details] ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງໃນ [menuitem]``Channel List`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Details`` tab shows the basic channel details, including a "
"description of the channel, and the dates it was last modified and built.  "
"This tab also provides contact information for the maintainer of the product "
"and the GPG key details, where available."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Details`` ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດພື້ນຖານຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ, ລວມທັງຄຳອະທິບາຍ, ວັນທີທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຖືກສ້າງຫຼ້າສຸດ. ແທັບນີ້ຍັງໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄີ GPG ຖ້າມີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managers"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຈັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Managers`` tab shows which users are authorized to manage the "
"selected channel.  The list shows the username, real name, and email address "
"of the channel manager, as well as the current status of the user."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Managers`` ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃດແດ່ທີ່ມີສິດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຊື່ແທ້, ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລຂອງຜູ້ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ, ລວມທັງສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Organization and Channel administrators can manage any channel.  "
"{productname} Administrators can change roles for specific users by clicking "
"the username."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບອົງກອນ ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງໃດກໍໄດ້. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ສາມາດປ່ຽນບົດບາດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information about user management, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:10
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-patches.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "ແພັດ (Patches)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Patches`` tab shows all available patches for packages in the "
"selected channel.  The list displays the advisory type, names, synopsis, and "
"the date the patch was last updated.  Click the advisory name to go to the "
"[guimenu]``Patch Details`` page."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Patches`` ສະແດງແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງປະເພດ advisory, ຊື່, ເນື້ອໃນຫຍໍ້, ແລະ ວັນທີທີ່ແພັດຖືກອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ advisory ເພື່ອໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``Patch Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about managing patches and packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:patch-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Packages`` tab shows all packages in the selected channel.  "
"The list shows the package name, summary, and the provider of the package.  "
"Click the package name to go to the [guimenu]``Package Details`` page."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Packages`` ສະແດງແພັກເກດທັງໝົດໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ແພັກເກດ, ບົດສະຫຼຸບ, ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກດ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ແພັກເກດເພື່ອໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``Package Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Subscribed Systems`` tab shows the clients currently "
"subscribed to the selected channel.  The list shows the client name and "
"type.  Check a client in the list to add it to the system set manager.  "
"Click the client name to go to the [guimenu]``System Details`` page."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscribed Systems`` ສະແດງໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງໄຄເອັນ. ໝາຍເລືອກໄຄເອັນໃນລາຍການເພື່ອເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (SSM). ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ໄຄເອັນເພື່ອໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:18
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (SSM), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Target Systems`` tab shows the clients eligible for "
"subscription to the selected channel.  This tab is only available if the "
"selected channel is a child channel.  The list shows the client name and "
"type, and the associated base channel."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``Target Systems`` ສະແດງໄຄເອັນທີ່ມີສິດລົງທະບຽນນຳໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ. ແທັບນີ້ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channel). ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງໄຄເອັນ, ລວມທັງຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel) ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To subscribe a client to the selected channel, check the client in the list, "
"and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກໄຄເອັນໃນລາຍການ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:22
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:6
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:3
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:12
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/ssm-overview.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information about software channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:23
#: en/modules/reference/pages/systems/system-details/sd-appstreams.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStreams"
msgstr "AppStreams"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``AppStreams`` tab is only visible for modular channels and it "
"shows all the available modules in the channel.  The list shows the module "
"name and the streams available for the module.  The default stream for each "
"module is indicated with a highlighted color."
msgstr "ແທັບ [guimenu]``AppStreams`` ຈະປາກົດສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາ (modular channels) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ມັນຈະສະແດງທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ໂມດູນ ແລະ ສະຕຣີມ (streams) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບໂມດູນນັ້ນ. ສະຕຣີມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍສີທີ່ເນັ້ນໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/channel-details.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information about AppStreams and how to use them, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ AppStreams ແລະ ວິທີການນຳໃຊ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Channels] section allows you to manage custom "
"channels."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Manage > Channels] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel] to create a new custom channel."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Channel] ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To clone an existing channel, click btn:[Clone Channel] and select the "
"channel to clone.  You can choose to clone channel with or without all "
"current patches, or select specific patches for inclusion."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Clone Channel] ແລ້ວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂຄລນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງພ້ອມກັບແພັດທັງໝົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເອົາແພັດກໍໄດ້, ຫຼື ເລືອກແພັດສະເພາະບາງອັນກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-channels.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:5
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Packages"
msgstr "ຈັດການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Packages] section allows you to manage packages "
"that are owned by your organization."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Manage > Packages] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການແພັກເກດທີ່ເປັນຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Select a channel from the drop-down box to see all packages related to that "
"channel.  If you have administration privileges within your organization, "
"you can also delete packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຈາກກ່ອງລາຍການເພື່ອເບິ່ງທຸກແພັກເກດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີສິດເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລຶບແພັກເກດໄດ້ນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Orphaned packages are packages that are synchronized by {productname}, but "
"not associated with a software channel.  For handling those packages, see "
"xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc#package-management-orphaned-packages[]."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ (Orphaned packages) ແມ່ນແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນໂດຍ {productname} ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃດໆ. ສຳລັບການຈັດການແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:package-management.adoc#package-management-orphaned-packages[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Repositories"
msgstr "ຈັດການຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (Repositories)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage > Repositories] section allows you to manage custom "
"or third-party package repositories and link the repositories to an existing "
"channel."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Manage > Repositories] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຫຼື ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄັງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເຂົ້າກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository] to create a new repository."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Repository] ເພື່ອສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/manage-repositories.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about custom repositories and channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel List Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List] section allows you to view and manage "
"software channels and packages on your clients."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Channel List] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ແພັກເກດໃນໄຄເອັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Channel List > All] section displays a list of all "
"software channels that are available to your organization."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Channel List > All] ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Each software channel in the list shows a channel name, a provider, the "
"number of packages and patches in the channel, and the number of clients "
"currently subscribed to the channel.  Click the plus sign next to the name "
"of a parent channel to expand the entry and see all the related child "
"channels.  Click the channel name to see more information about the channel."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃນລາຍການຈະສະແດງຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ, ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ຈຳນວນແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ຈຳນວນໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນນຳໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກທີ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກຂ້າງຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Within the menu:Software[Channel List] section you can select which subset "
"of channels you would like to see by navigating to tabs, or the sub-menu "
"items."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Channel List] ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເບິ່ງກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ແທັບຕ່າງໆ ຫຼື ລາຍການເມນູຍ່ອຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel List Filters"
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-channel-list-menu.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Filter      | Description\n"
"| All         | All channels available to your organization.\n"
"| SUSE        | Channels provided by {suse}.\n"
"| Popular     | Channels most subscribed to by clients in your "
"organization.\n"
"| My Channels | Software channels that belong to your organization, "
"including custom channels.\n"
"| Shared      | Channels shared with others in the organizational trust.\n"
"| Retired     | Channels that have reached end-of-life and no longer receive "
"updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ      | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| All         | ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
"| SUSE        | ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ {suse}.\n"
"| Popular     | ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີໄຄເອັນໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານລົງທະບຽນນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"
"| My Channels | ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ເປັນຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ.\n"
"| Shared      | ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ແບ່ງປັນກັບອົງກອນອື່ນໃນລະບົບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື (trust).\n"
"| Retired     | ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (end-of-life) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Channel Mapping"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ຊ່ອງທາງການແຈກຢາຍ (Distribution Channel Mapping)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Distribution Channel Mapping] section lists your defined "
"default base channels.  When you register a client for the first time, they "
"will automatically be assigned to these software channels, in accordance "
"with their architecture and operating system.  Default channel mappings can "
"be edited, but not deleted."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Distribution Channel Mapping] ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channels) ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໄວ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານລົງທະບຽນໄຄເອັນເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຕາມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ ແລະ ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງເຄື່ອງ. ການຈັບຄູ່ຊ່ອງທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:3
msgid "Click btn:[Create Distribution Channel Mapping] to create a new channel map."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Distribution Channel Mapping] ເພື່ອສ້າງການຈັບຄູ່ຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Channel Mapping Columns"
msgstr "ຄໍລຳຂອງການຈັບຄູ່ຊ່ອງທາງການແຈກຢາຍ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-distribution-channel-mapping.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Column                | Description\n"
"| Operating System      | The client operating system this mapping applies "
"to.\n"
"| Release               | The operating system release this mapping applies "
"to.\n"
"| Architecture          | The client system architecture this mapping "
"applies to.\n"
"| Channel Label         | The label of the channel.\n"
"| Organization Specific | Checked if this mapping applies only to the "
"current organization.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄໍລຳ                | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Operating System      | ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງໄຄເອັນທີ່ການຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| Release               | ເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ການຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| Architecture          | ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງລະບົບໄຄເອັນທີ່ການຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"
"| Channel Label         | ປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ.\n"
"| Organization Specific | ໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້ຖ້າການຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບອົງກອນປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູຈັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-manage-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The menu:Software[Manage] section allows you to manage custom channels, "
"packages, and repositories."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Manage] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແພັກເກດ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-menu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Software`` section allows you to view and manage software "
"channels, repositories, and packages."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Software`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ, ແລະ ແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Search"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:2
msgid "The menu:Software[Package Search] section allows you to search all packages."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Package Search] ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:3
msgid "Enter your search term in the [guimenu]``Search For`` field."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຄຳຄົ້ນຫາຂອງທ່ານໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Search For``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to Search Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຈະຄົ້ນຫາ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option               | Description\n"
"| Free form            | Performs a general search.\n"
"Use keywords with this option to perform more specific searches.\n"
"| Name only            | Searches only in the names of packages.\n"
"| Name and Summary     | Searches within the name and one-line summary of "
"packages.\n"
"| Name and Description | Searches within names and long descriptions of "
"packages.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຕົວເລືອກ               | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"| Free form            | ດຳເນີນການຄົ້ນຫາທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ (keywords) ກັບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະບຸເຈາະຈົງ.\n"
"| Name only            | ຄົ້ນຫາສະເພາະໃນຊື່ຂອງແພັກເກດ.\n"
"| Name and Summary     | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ ແລະ ບົດສະຫຼຸບຫຍໍ້ຂອງແພັກເກດ.\n"
"| Name and Description | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງແພັກເກດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Channels relevant to your systems`` option to search "
"only channels available for your existing clients.  Check the "
"[guimenu]``Specific channel you have access to`` option to search within a "
"specific channel.  Check the [guimenu]``Packages of a specific "
"architecture`` to search only for a particular hardware architecture."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Channels relevant to your systems`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ. ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Specific channel you have access to`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ. ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Packages of a specific architecture`` ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາສະເພາະແພັກເກດຂອງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮາດແວໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can perform more specific searches by using keywords in the "
"[guimenu]``Search For`` field and selecting the [guimenu]``Free Form`` "
"option."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາແບບເຈາະຈົງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Search For`` ແລະ ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Free Form``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keyword Search Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຄົ້ນຫາດ້ວຍຄຳສຳຄັນ"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Keyword     | Description | Example\n"
"| name        | Search package names | ``name:SUSE``\n"
"| version     | Search for a package version | ``version:15``\n"
"| filename    | Search within package file names | ``filename:sles``\n"
"| description | Search within the long description | ``description:java``\n"
"| summary     | Search within the one-line summary | ``summary:java``\n"
"| arch        | Search for a package architecture | ``arch:x86_64``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳສຳຄັນ     | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
"| name        | ຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ແພັກເກດ | ``name:SUSE``\n"
"| version     | ຄົ້ນຫາເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດ | ``version:15``\n"
"| filename    | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງແພັກເກດ | ``filename:sles``\n"
"| description | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດ | ``description:java``\n"
"| summary     | ຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນບົດສະຫຼຸບຫຍໍ້ | ``summary:java``\n"
"| arch        | ຄົ້ນຫາຕາມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງແພັກເກດ | ``arch:x86_64``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For example, if you want to search all {sle} packages that include `java` in "
"the description and the summary, use this search:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາທຸກແພັກເກດ {sle} ທີ່ມີຄຳວ່າ `java` ໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍ ແລະ ບົດສະຫຼຸບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/software/software-package-search.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "summary:java and description:java\n"
msgstr "summary:java and description:java\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd Reference"
msgstr "ການອ້າງອີງ spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The following section will help you become more familiar with the "
"[command]``spacecmd`` command-line interface.  This interface is available "
"for {productname}, Satellite and Spacewalk servers.  spacecmd is written in "
"Python and uses the XML-RPC API provided by the server."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບ [command]``spacecmd`` command-line interface ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບເຊີເວີ {productname}, Satellite ແລະ Spacewalk. spacecmd ຖືກຂຽນດ້ວຍພາສາ Python ແລະ ໃຊ້ XML-RPC API ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "What can spacecmd do for me?"
msgstr "spacecmd ສາມາດເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Manage almost all aspects of {productname} from the command line with "
"spacecmd"
msgstr "ຈັດການເກືອບທຸກດ້ານຂອງ {productname} ຈາກ command line ດ້ວຍ spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:6
msgid "Tab completion is available for all commands"
msgstr "ມີລະບົບຊ່ວຍພິມ (Tab completion) ສຳລັບທຸກຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Single commands can be passed to spacecmd without entering the interactive "
"shell (excellent for shell scripts)"
msgstr "ສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງດ່ຽວໄປຫາ spacecmd ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ interactive shell (ເໝາະສຳລັບການຂຽນ shell scripts)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:8
msgid "May also be accessed and used as an interactive shell"
msgstr "ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານເປັນ interactive shell ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Advanced search methods are available for finding specific systems, thus "
"removing the need to create system groups (nevertheless groups are still "
"recommended)"
msgstr "ມີວິທີການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດສຳລັບການຊອກຫາລະບົບສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ (ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ການໃຊ້ກຸ່ມຍັງເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ແນະນຳ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd-intro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Complete functionality through the Spacewalk API. Almost all commands that "
"can be executed from the {webui} can be performed via the spacecmd "
"command-line"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ສົມບູນຜ່ານ Spacewalk API. ເກືອບທຸກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກ {webui} ແມ່ນສາມາດເຮັດຜ່ານ spacecmd command-line ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (activationkey)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:2
msgid "The following spacecmd commands are available for use with activation keys."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ spacecmd ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ activation keys."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addchildchannels"
msgstr "activationkey_addchildchannels"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:4
msgid "Add child channels to an activation key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels) ເຂົ້າໃນ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:5
msgid "usage: activationkey_addchildchannels KEY <CHANNEL ...>"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_addchildchannels KEY <CHANNEL ...>"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addconfigchannels"
msgstr "activationkey_addconfigchannels"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:7
msgid "Add configuration channels to an activation key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ (configuration channels) ເຂົ້າໃນ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:8
msgid "usage: activationkey_addconfigchannels KEY <CHANNEL ...> [options]"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_addconfigchannels KEY <CHANNEL ...> [options]"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:9
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/system.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -t add channels to the top of the list\n"
"  -b add channels to the bottom of the list\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"  -t ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໄປໄວ້ທາງເທິງສຸດຂອງລາຍການ\n"
"  -b ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໄປໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງລາຍການ\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addentitlements"
msgstr "activationkey_addentitlements"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:11
msgid "Add available entitlements to an activation key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສິດການນຳໃຊ້ (entitlements) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ກັບ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:12
msgid "usage: activationkey_addentitlements KEY <ENTITLEMENT ...>"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_addentitlements KEY <ENTITLEMENT ...>"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the WebUI entitlements are known as System Types.  Nevertheless the "
"spacecmd backend still utilizes the entitlements term.  Therefore any "
"scripts you may be using can remain unchanged."
msgstr "ໃນ WebUI, entitlements ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ System Types. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານຂອງ spacecmd ຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ຄຳວ່າ entitlements ຢູ່. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ສະຄຣິບຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ຢູ່ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addgroups"
msgstr "activationkey_addgroups"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:15
msgid "Add existing groups to an activation key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໃນ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:16
msgid "usage: activationkey_addgroups KEY <GROUP ...>"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_addgroups KEY <GROUP ...>"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_addpackages"
msgstr "activationkey_addpackages"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:18
msgid "Add packages to an activation key."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໃນ activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:19
msgid "usage: activationkey_addpackages KEY <PACKAGE ...>"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_addpackages KEY <PACKAGE ...>"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_clone"
msgstr "activationkey_clone"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:21
msgid "Clone an existing activation key."
msgstr "ໂຄລນ activation key ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"usage examples:\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key -c bar_key\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key1 foo_key2 -c prefix\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key -x \"s/foo/bar\"\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key1 foo_key2 -x \"s/foo/bar\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງວິທີໃຊ້:\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key -c bar_key\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key1 foo_key2 -c prefix\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key -x \"s/foo/bar\"\n"
"                 activationkey_clone foo_key1 foo_key2 -x \"s/foo/bar\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -c CLONE_NAME  : Name of the resulting key, treated as a prefix for "
"multiple\n"
"                   keys\n"
"  -x \"s/foo/bar\" : Optional regex replacement, replaces foo with bar in "
"the\n"
"                   clone description, base-channel label, child-channel\n"
"                   labels, config-channel names\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"  -c CLONE_NAME  : ຊື່ຂອງຄີທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການໂຄລນ, ໃຊ້ເປັນຄຳນຳໜ້າສຳລັບຫຼາຍໆຄີ\n"
"  -x \"s/foo/bar\" : ການແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ regex (ທາງເລືອກ), ແທນທີ່ foo ດ້ວຍ bar ໃນ\n"
"                   ຄຳອະທິບາຍການໂຄລນ, ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ, ປ້າຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ,\n"
"                   ແລະ ຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_create"
msgstr "activationkey_create"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:25
msgid "Create a new activation key."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:26
msgid "usage: activationkey_create [options]"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_create [options]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -n NAME\n"
"  -d DESCRIPTION\n"
"  -b BASE_CHANNEL\n"
"  -u set key as universal default\n"
"  -e [enterprise_entitled,virtualization_host]\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"  -n NAME (ຊື່)\n"
"  -d DESCRIPTION (ຄຳອະທິບາຍ)\n"
"  -b BASE_CHANNEL (ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ)\n"
"  -u ກຳນົດຄີໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທົ່ວໄປ (universal default)\n"
"  -e [enterprise_entitled,virtualization_host]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_delete"
msgstr "activationkey_delete"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:29
msgid "Delete an existing activation key."
msgstr "ລຶບ activation key ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:30
msgid "usage: activationkey_delete KEY"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_delete KEY"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_details"
msgstr "activationkey_details"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:32
msgid "Show details of an existing activation key."
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ activation key ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:33
msgid "usage: activationkey_details KEY ..."
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: activationkey_details KEY ..."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/activationkey.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "activationkey_diff"
