#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "api"
msgstr "api"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The following API command and its options are available for calling the "
"XML-RPC API directly.  Calling the API directly allows you to use the latest "
"features in {productname} from the command-line using spacecmd as a wrapper "
"for stand-alone commands or used from within scripts."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ API ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຂອງມັນມີໄວ້ສຳລັບເອີ້ນໃຊ້ XML-RPC API ໂດຍກົງ. ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ໂດຍກົງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼ້າສຸດໃນ {productname} ຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ ໂດຍໃຊ້ spacecmd ເປັນຕົວຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນສະຄຣິບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To gain access to the latest feature additions call [command]``api "
"api.getApiCallList`` from within spacecmd to list all currently available "
"API commands formatted in json."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໆ ໃຫ້ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``api api.getApiCallList`` ພາຍໃນ spacecmd ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄຳສັ່ງ API ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີໃນຮູບແບບ json."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "api_"
msgstr "api_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:5
msgid "Call XML-RPC API with arguments directly."
msgstr "ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ XML-RPC API ພ້ອມກັບອາກິວເມນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:6
msgid "usage: api [options] API_STRING"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: api [ຕົວເລືອກ] API_STRING"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -A, --args  Arguments for the API other than session id in comma "
"separated\n"
"              strings or JSON expression\n"
"  -F, --format   Output format\n"
"  -o, --output   Output file\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"  -A, --args  ອາກິວເມນສຳລັບ API ນອກເໜືອຈາກ session id ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ\n"
"              ຫຼື ໃຊ້ JSON expression\n"
"  -F, --format   ຮູບແບບການສະແດງຜົນ\n"
"  -o, --output   ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/api.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"examples:\n"
"  api api.getApiCallList\n"
"  api --args \"sysgroup_A\" systemgroup.listSystems\n"
"  api -A \"rhel-i386-server-5,2011-04-01,2011-05-01\" -F \"%(name)s\" \\\n"
"      channel.software.listAllPackages\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"  api api.getApiCallList\n"
"  api --args \"sysgroup_A\" systemgroup.listSystems\n"
"  api -A \"rhel-i386-server-5,2011-04-01,2011-05-01\" -F \"%(name)s\" \\\n"
"      channel.software.listAllPackages\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/clear.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "clear"
msgstr "ລຶບ"

#. type: Plain text
