msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ RuleResults ທັງໝົດສຳລັບການສະແກນ OpenSCAP XCCDF ທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: scap_getxccdfscanruleresults <XID>\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: scap_getxccdfscanruleresults <XID>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "scap_listxccdfscans"
msgstr "scap_listxccdfscans"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:10
msgid "Return a list of finished OpenSCAP scans for given systems."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄືນລາຍຊື່ການສະແກນ OpenSCAP ທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: scap_listxccdfscans <SYSTEMS>\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: scap_listxccdfscans <SYSTEMS>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "scap_schedulexccdfscan"
msgstr "scap_schedulexccdfscan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:13
msgid "Schedule Scap XCCDF scan."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສະແກນ Scap XCCDF."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: scap_schedulexccdfscan PATH_TO_XCCDF_FILE XCCDF_OPTIONS SYSTEMS\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: scap_schedulexccdfscan PATH_TO_XCCDF_FILE XCCDF_OPTIONS SYSTEMS\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/scap.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Example:\n"
"> scap_schedulexccdfscan '/usr/share/openscap/scap-security-xccdf.xml' "
"'profile Web-Default' \\\n"
"system-scap.example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"> scap_schedulexccdfscan '/usr/share/openscap/scap-security-xccdf.xml' 'profile Web-Default' \\\n"
"system-scap.example.com\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "schedule"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:2
msgid "The following spacecmd functions are available for working with scheduling."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ spacecmd ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກກັບການກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "schedule_cancel"
msgstr "schedule_cancel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:4
msgid "Cancel a scheduled action."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: schedule_cancel ID|* ...\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: schedule_cancel ID|* ...\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "schedule_details"
msgstr "schedule_details"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:7
msgid "Show the details of a scheduled action."
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: schedule_details ID\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: schedule_details ID\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "schedule_getoutput"
msgstr "schedule_getoutput"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:10
msgid "Show the output from an action."
msgstr "ສະແດງຜົນການເຮັດວຽກ (output) ຈາກການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: schedule_getoutput ID\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: schedule_getoutput ID\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "schedule_list"
msgstr "schedule_list"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:13
msgid "List all actions."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ການດຳເນີນການທັງໝົດ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: schedule_list [BEGINDATE] [ENDDATE]\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: schedule_list [ວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ] [ວັນທີສິ້ນສຸດ]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:15
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:21
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:26
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:32
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Dates can be any of the following:\n"
"Explicit Dates:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as explicit date strings in the YYYYMMDD[HHMM] "
"format.\n"
"The year, month and day are required, while the hours and minutes are not; "
"the hours and minutes will default to 0000 if no values are provided.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີສາມາດເປັນຮູບແບບໃດໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"
"ວັນທີທີ່ລະບຸເຈາະຈົງ:\n"
"ວັນທີສາມາດລະບຸເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບແບບ YYYYMMDD[HHMM].\n"
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸ ປີ, ເດືອນ ແລະ ວັນ, ສ່ວນ ຊົ່ວໂມງ ແລະ ນາທີ ຈະລະບຸຫຼືບໍ່ກໍໄດ້;\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ລະບຸ, ຊົ່ວໂມງ ແລະ ນາທີ ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 0000.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:16
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:22
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:27
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:33
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/schedule.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deltas:\n"
"Dates can be expressed as delta values.  For example, '2h' would mean 2 "
"hours in the future.  You can also use negative values to express times in "
"the past (e.g., -7d would be one week ago).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (Deltas):\n"
"ວັນທີສາມາດລະບຸເປັນຄ່າໄລຍະຫ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, '2h' ໝາຍເຖິງ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງໃນອະນາຄົດ.\n"
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າລົບເພື່ອລະບຸເວລາໃນອະດີດໄດ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, -7d ແມ່ນ ໜຶ່ງອາທິດກ່ອນ).\n"

