#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd Functions"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຂອງ spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/spacecmd-functions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The following sections provide descriptions for all documented spacecmd "
"commands.  Each command is grouped by the function prefix.  Keep in mind "
"that all commands may also be called using scripts and passed to spacecmd as "
"stand-alone commands."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຫ້ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ spacecmd ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ. ແຕ່ລະຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມຄຳນຳໜ້າຂອງຟັງຊັນ. ຄຳສັ່ງທັງໝົດຍັງສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບໄດ້."

