msgstr "toggle_confirmations"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/toggle.adoc:4
msgid "Toggle confirmation messages on/off."
msgstr "ສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຢືນຢັນ ເປີດ/ປິດ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/toggle.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: toggle_confirmations\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: toggle_confirmations\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting spacecmd"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ spacecmd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:2
msgid "This section provides troubleshooting solutions when working with spacecmd"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກກັບ spacecmd"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Creating a distribution where ``spacecmd`` sets ``localhost`` instead of "
"FQDN"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ distribution ທີ່ ``spacecmd`` ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``localhost`` ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ FQDN"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Situation"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When creating a distribution with spacecmd it will automatically set "
"[literal]``localhost`` as the server name instead of the FQDN of "
"{productname}.  This will result in the following kernel option being "
"written:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງ distribution ດ້ວຍ spacecmd, ມັນຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ເຊີເວີເປັນ ``localhost`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ FQDN ຂອງ {productname}. ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ kernel option ຖືກຂຽນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:6
msgid "install=http://localhost/ks/dist/<distributionname>"
msgstr "install=http://localhost/ks/dist/<distributionname>"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:8
msgid "Set the FQDN in [path]``$HOME/.spacecmd/config`` like the following:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ FQDN ໃນ [path]``$HOME/.spacecmd/config`` ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:9
msgid "test:~/.spacecmd # cat config"
msgstr "test:~/.spacecmd # cat config"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:10
msgid "server=test.mytest.env username=admin password=password nossl=0"
msgstr "server=test.mytest.env username=admin password=password nossl=0"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "ສາເຫດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This problem may be experienced if [path]``$HOME/.spacecmd/config`` has been "
"created and the server name option was set to [literal]``localhost``."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຖ້າ [path]``$HOME/.spacecmd/config`` ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກຊື່ເຊີເວີຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ ``localhost``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "``spacecmd`` not accepting commands or options"
msgstr "``spacecmd`` ບໍ່ຍອມຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:14
msgid "When running [command]``spacecmd`` non-interactively:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [command]``spacecmd`` ແບບ non-interactively:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:15
msgid "you must escape arguments passed to the command."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ escape ສຳລັບພາລາມິເຕີທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:16
msgid ""
"always put ``--`` before arguments, to avoid them being treated as global "
"arguments."
msgstr "ໃສ່ ``--`` ກ່ອນພາລາມິເຕີສະເໝີ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ເປັນ global arguments."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:17
msgid ""
"make sure you escape any quotes that you pass to the functions so that they "
"are not interpreted."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ escape ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າໃດໆ ທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ລະບົບແປຄວາມໝາຍຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:18
msgid "An example of a well-formed [command]``spacecmd`` command:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacecmd`` ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:19
msgid ""
"spacecmd -s server1 -- softwarechannel_create -n \\'My Channel\\' -l "
"channel1 -a x86_64"
msgstr "spacecmd -s server1 -- softwarechannel_create -n \\'My Channel\\' -l channel1 -a x86_64"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "``spacecmd`` caching problems"
msgstr "ບັນຫາການເຮັດແຄຊ (caching) ຂອງ ``spacecmd``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacecmd`` command keeps a cache of the various systems and "
"packages that you have installed.  Sometimes, this can result in a mismatch "
"between the system name and the system ID."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacecmd`` ຈະເກັບແຄຊຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ບາງຄັ້ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການບໍ່ກົງກັນລະຫວ່າງຊື່ລະບົບ ແລະ ໄອດີລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:22
msgid "To clear the [command]``spacecmd`` cache, use this command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບແຄຊຂອງ [command]``spacecmd``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/troubleshooting-spacecmd.adoc:23
msgid "spacecmd clear_caches"
msgstr "spacecmd clear_caches"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "user"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (user)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:2
msgid "The following spacecmd functions are available managing users."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ spacecmd ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບການຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_adddefaultgroup"
msgstr "user_adddefaultgroup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:4
msgid "Add a default group to an user account."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_adddefaultgroup USER <GROUP ...>\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_adddefaultgroup USER <GROUP ...>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_addgroup"
msgstr "user_addgroup"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:7
msgid "Add a group to an user account."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_addgroup USER <GROUP ...>\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_addgroup USER <GROUP ...>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_addrole"
msgstr "user_addrole"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:10
msgid "Add a role to an user account."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມບົດບາດ (role) ໃຫ້ກັບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_addrole USER ROLE\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_addrole USER ROLE\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_create"
msgstr "user_create"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:13
msgid "Create an user."
msgstr "ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_create [options]\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_create [ຕົວເລືອກ]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  -u USERNAME\n"
"  -f FIRST_NAME\n"
"  -l LAST_NAME\n"
"  -e EMAIL\n"
"  -p PASSWORD\n"
"  --pam enable PAM authentication\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ:\n"
"  -u USERNAME\n"
"  -f FIRST_NAME\n"
"  -l LAST_NAME\n"
"  -e EMAIL\n"
"  -p PASSWORD\n"
"  --pam ເປີດໃຊ້ການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນແບບ PAM\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_delete"
msgstr "user_delete"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:17
msgid "Delete an user."
msgstr "ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_delete NAME\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_delete ຊື່\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "user_details"
msgstr "user_details"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:20
msgid "Show the details of an user."
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
