msgstr "ລຶບກຸ່ມອອກຈາກບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/reference/pages/spacecmd/user.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: user_removegroup USER <GROUP ...>\n"
msgstr "ວິທີໃຊ້: user_removegroup ຜູ້ໃຊ້ <ກຸ່ມ ...>\n"

#. type: Title ==
